================================================================================
Fix Group_* Business View leaking ungrouped orphan entities
================================================================================

Context:
Selecting a Group_<name> Business View (e.g. Group_Contract) in Ontology Studio
showed entities that were not members of the group, often as isolated
orphan-looking nodes. The canvas filtered with a stale hiddenEntities blacklist
only, so entities added after the snapshot (or never recorded as hidden) leaked
in. Collapse persist also grew the BV entities list from the All-map position
cache.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-map.js
   Whitelist visible entities via _studioViewVisibleNames; Group_* views follow
   live group membership; stop growing BV entities from the global position cache.
2. tests/units/front/test_studio_views_groups_contract.py
   Contracts for whitelist filter, Group_* live members, and no cache growth.
3. docs/user-guide.md
   Document that Group_<groupName> views show current group members.

