================================================================================
Limit Group_* Business Views to group members
================================================================================

Context:
The inheritance-neighbour expansion added in the previous change pulled every
superclass/subclass of a group member onto a Group_* view, even when that
neighbour belongs to another group (e.g. Claim and Interaction appearing in
Group_Contract). Group_* views now show exactly the group's members; links
between members (including inheritance) are still drawn.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-map.js
   Removed _studioExpandVisibleWithInheritance and its call; the Group_* filter
   uses live membership only.
